{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d28515dd29dcaa71e35f5a215fcada09cd5e724c02df23515c24b4e6f41f729", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です。\n……あれ、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n……咦，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1dcaa5d873da8d76cd96800a8466244a2690f4f28ea6e717aab7541db3368a3", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nいえ、ちょっと不思議なんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n不是，只是觉得有点不可思议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "62dbb5fc533388c7d10ad17017774987ce1d7c503f2d18543b28d202f5301881", "ja": "自分が知らない物のはずなのに、なぜか懐かしさを\n感じるような……そんな経験ってありますか？", "zh": "明明是自己不认识的东西，却不知为何会感到怀念……您有过这样的经历吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "83467d6d357a212d4c895703c1e7e709b09d90f21dab074caf31f664d0f5837d", "ja": "知らないのに懐かしい……。ああ、それならこの間、\n訪問先で黒電話を見た時、そんな気分になりましたね。", "zh": "明明不认识，却感到怀念……。啊，说起来，前几天去拜访的时候，看到一部黑色拨盘电话，就有那种感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "465c8cc83498b1a515b68176a74ac08b289491b8843af1734ee495669ca3b28a", "ja": "黒電話……あ、ぐるぐる回すダイヤル式の？", "zh": "黑色电话……啊，是指那种要转动拨盘的拨号式电话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f69476f427026e3b97f74e8f546be179c88e0367b565d6ee3b825308b38e6746", "ja": "はい。今でも普通に使えるそうですよ。折り返しが\nできないとか、不便さもあるみたいですが……。", "zh": "是的。听说现在也还能正常使用。好像也有无法回拨之类的不便……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a80e88491f739820e06b38e5739d0b57236fb131ad0ff75ddec48e8e264ddcec", "ja": "味わい深くて好きなんだと、その方は仰ってましたね。\n確かに、なんともいえない懐きがありました。", "zh": "那位客人还说，正是因为别有一番韵味才喜欢的呢。\n确实，让人感到一种说不出的怀念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "11ae96820b5b96dfb998ea9cae2ceab629da66ed8dd2b36b006507adafcde121", "ja": "普段使っている携帯電話とはだいぶ違いますけど、\nまあ、先祖みたいなものじゃないですか。", "zh": "虽然和平时用的手机差别挺大，\n不过说起来，也算是它的祖先吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8675f8c7aca792f6beee92601e82b42009a50fffdb8389678e43b4ceff2bf684", "ja": "そこに歴史を感じるというか……古い物に惹かれるのは\n自分の思い出を重ねるからかもしれませんね。", "zh": "总觉得能从中感受到历史……或许是因为会将自己的回忆寄托在古老的物件上，所以才会被它们吸引吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "58aa695b594a4d8f343f2e12d9277b756b54782448d952da4b73b49fbeba3787", "ja": "自分の思い出を重ねる……そうなのかも！\nミシンには思い出がいっぱいだし！", "zh": "把自己的回忆叠加上去……或许真是这样！缝纫机承载着好多回忆呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "628b7718ee1bbf33f3c8d6ae0da8fc1ffb862ca3a03753ef1bac53be5a312e10", "ja": "ミシン？", "zh": "缝纫机？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "8668296fb57f4570293e7b800ec2141484139b27f0c413272daaa49f93e7bd8c", "ja": "あっ、いえ！　そういえば今日は事務所に行くんじゃ\nありませんでした？　社長さんに呼ばれて……。", "zh": "啊，不是！对了，您今天不是要去事务所吗？社长叫您过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "62be5a8792b59ee2c627793c99b559df205d29b3fb66a45297d46b46e8c4049d", "ja": "おっと、いけない。そろそろでした。\nそれじゃあ、行ってきますね。", "zh": "哎呀，不好，差不多到时间了。那我先过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "61833e32896ec22863e32c510e40043ad858d6141ee2f6a002021c79407f5528", "ja": "はーい、お気をつけて！", "zh": "好——路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "27af146c233ed95187127815ea92f22d424ed4b154ec775e6b4d57770f6c56c9", "ja": "古い物かぁ……。そうだ、しまいこんでた昔のお茶碗が\nあったっけ。今度、あれでお茶を淹れてみようかな？", "zh": "老物件啊……对了，我记得有个收起来很久的旧茶碗。下次要不要试着用那个泡茶呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1015_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "92c322586a4650766fa5e6e08fdd4db116cb60fc20e5b0945ffc6ec77cf2c5ae", "ja": "おお、君！　よく来てくれたね。\n用件は先に伝えたとおりだが、資料は見てくれたかな？", "zh": "哦，是你啊！真是来得正好。\n要办的事就像之前说的那样，资料你看过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5606b5c9f9786233e06d2707c6443eb0130ec6b5dfe3fe9d10384a8649273fa8", "ja": "はい！　以前に恵美たちが出演したスチームパンク映画\nの、続編が決まったそうですね！", "zh": "是的！听说之前惠美她们出演的蒸汽朋克电影，已经决定要拍续集了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "069de79ca613ea5cb0a7d64b5ceca80430f9b25e536122363a84da5dcd29a444", "ja": "そうなんだよ。しかも今回は我が765プロのアイドル\n全員が参加する、大がかりなプロジェクトだ！", "zh": "没错。而且这次还是我家765事务所全体偶像参加的大型企划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "772026abe95b495cab9eacf9729eed3bbd2ab044f88a7860a0892c01d1d28ef9", "ja": "スチームパンクって根強い人気がありますよね。\n蒸気の世界の冒険譚！　私も前作で手に汗握りました♪", "zh": "蒸汽朋克一直都很受欢迎呢。\n蒸汽世界的冒险故事！我在前作里也看得紧张得手心冒汗呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "abccd79523cdb26a393e684980a527841b87a8534aa8f355e676c294847f1d3a", "ja": "人間とロボットが敵対する世界観も話題を呼んだねぇ。\n期待されていた続編が、ついに実現したというわけだ。", "zh": "人类与机器人敌对的世界观也引发了热议呢。  \n备受期待的续作终于实现了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "fde5f7fc8d3fab5dcf1d9cf6fcfc179b76f65f8d52e3729c9b248b16408f8dc1", "ja": "ありがたい限りです。アイドルたちの頑張りと、\nファンの方々の後押しのおかげですね。", "zh": "真是让人感激不尽。这都多亏了偶像们的努力，以及粉丝们的支持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "7eb67e6d17e1f2951229b035cf13c1b9ee4e3651033936a1ce9087db3343f077", "ja": "うむ。今度もぜひ、期待に応えたいところだ。\n君、やってくれるね？", "zh": "嗯。下次也想回应大家的期待啊。\n\n你会做到的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "428971a8c21d67d991e361a7bbba10122da89afae85deab35837bf12879f5b97", "ja": "もちろんです。夢と蒸気と機械の世界の、新しい\n物語を、みなさんにお届けできるよう力を尽くします。", "zh": "那是当然。为了能将充满梦想、蒸汽与机械之世界的新故事\n呈现给大家，我会全力以赴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "86dabeb1ef2f807d4543bfd66e426f433b805c122ed32446a34efabe0e54d42e", "ja": "とっても楽しみです！　前回は、\nすごく気になるところで終わっちゃいましたし。", "zh": "我非常期待！上次故事刚好在让人特别在意的地方结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "2575f4cfebf22c69248ac1e32b5e463cba6fa2e823a17610834b35221f7cc028", "ja": "うむ。前回は確か、人間そっくりの高性能ロボットが\n支配する蒸気機関の世界で……。", "zh": "嗯。上次好像是在一个由酷似人类的高性能机器人支配的蒸汽机世界里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "305cd47c0c31e56ebed80ff86a0d2d6e296a88e7f743e1531a286916ffb13376", "ja": "所恵美君演じる飛行機乗りと、\n萩原雪歩君演じるメカニックが、", "zh": "由所惠美君饰演的飞行员，\n以及由萩原雪步君饰演的机械师，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0398_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0398_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "2686e75940ad9f14d1ae53d6dc922cf8c9cbf1ef28edec66174124a4e5074c7b", "ja": "周防桃子君演じるロボットの少女と出会う……。\nそんな胸躍るストーリーだったね！", "zh": "与周防桃子饰演的机器人少女相遇……  \n真是个令人心潮澎湃的故事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
